name: convention-by-copy
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: false
note: a single pre-existing example was treated as the convention and copied,
  when the authority it had to agree with (the emitter, the schema, the caller)
  was right there and cheaper to read. Fires when the copied example turns out
  to be wrong and unpinned — nothing exercised it, so it looked settled.
